  exploding & the object is visible where it has traveled the furthest
  distance. Frames 1 & 2 illustrate little (if any) change to Charlie's
  body/posture with the object having moved in both frames. *If* Charlie
  WOULD HAVE BEEN the same in all 3 frames *maybe* his bullshit is
  believeable when it comes to the object being recorded out of order -
  *but* since Charlie's shirt explodes in Frame 3 - the object was recorded
  CORRECTLY. He just talked everyone into a pretzel. This was point 1 of 2
  that I wanted to make last night.
